@AI: no emojis in comments and omit sections that are not relevant to the code.

@AI: all code blocks, functions, Loops, Case / Switch statements, variables structs need to have detailed multi-line comment blocks that explain all the code, why's and how's if needed to make a non-technical person or project manager understand what the code block is responsible for.

@AI: focus on input instructions wrapped in {{}}

@AI: Log output need to be prefixed as follows
🟥 [ERROR ]: {{log - critical program issues}}
🟨 [WARN  ]: {{log - program issues}}
🟧 [DEBUG ]: {{log - invalid user input, suspicious activity, elevated access}}
🟪 [USER  ]: {{log - invalid user input, suspicious activity, elevated access}}
🟩 [INFO  ]: {{log - normal program output, program start, program calls}}
🟦 [CONN  ]: {{log - remote connections established, ip info, geo info}}
🟫 [DCONN ]: {{log - remote connection disconnected, disconnected ip info or geo info}} 

@AI: Developer Notes are as needed and are not required. if no caveats, notices, or callouts, mark (none)
@AI: template starts here:
